or-byte parity.\n- **Worktree Diff Parity \u0026 Config Hygiene (`gates_quality_brownfield.go`, `gates_tdd_polyglot.go`, `gates_tdd_exclude.go`, `gate.go`, `git_helpers.go`):** Updated `shouldScopeTDDToModifiedPackages` so worktrees evaluate modified packages and files unless `verify_scope: \"repo\"`, `--all`, or `--baseline` is active; honored explicit `tdd_mode` (`diff` / `ratchet`) under `--strict`; implemented recursive `**`/`*` glob matching (`MatchTDDExcludeGlob`) for `tdd_exclude`; and passed `-uall` to `git status --porcelain` so newly created untracked folders are inspected.\n- **Anti-Tamper Threshold Integrity (`intent_twin_mode.go`):** Guarded against worktree downgrades of `verify_scope` (`repo -\u003e diff`) and unauthorized worktree expansion of `tdd_exclude` relative to trunk `nomos.yaml`.\n\n## Verification\n- Added `config_modes_test.go` and `gates_tdd_exclude_test.go`, regenerated `nomos.schema.json`, and verified all 42 DoD quality gates pass via `nomos verify`.\n\n","sha256_receipt":"0232f9aa9f90641e5333f0dc5329d8da0e3c9337e4d02da5fd88d8537f731cbb"}
